Z||000000||Gerald||10-24-2001||08:19 PM|||| So with winter here, I have been so forthunate as to only need to drive my Fiero for another month. Once parked she will be getting a full restore plus a new engine.<P> These are the engins I was thinking of.<P>2.0 turbo<BR>3.1 v6<BR>3.4 gm crate<BR>4.3 v6<BR>or making the duke a 2.7<P> I would like to know your thoughts on this or any other suggestions. I will not be doing the swap my self as my new job will keep me very busy thru winter. The shop Im taking it to puts v8,s into fiero based lambo replicas and their shop rate is great. I am looking to be able to get around 200 plus hp. Not likly wit the duke but the duke would be the easyest/cheapest. <P> Oh ya I plan on keeping my 5 speed untill it brakes  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P> Thanx and I look forward to your suggestions<P>------------------<BR>87 coupe 5 spd||||reg||6
