Z||000019||Gerald||10-25-2001||09:03 PM||||While working on the car today I began to relize that she has alot of little problems. Not enuf to make me want to sell her and its nothing that a good parts car wont fix, but alot of problems non the less. I still want to do the swap but I think Im gonna keep the price of the engine down. 2500 cdn is about all Im willing to spend on the new engine. So a turbo 2.8 is outta the question. But a mild modded 2.5 is in that range isnt it? Or a 3.1. Something real simple to install. The cost of the install itself doesent worry me too much. I got friends in all the right places.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
